# Dictation engine (whisper.cpp binaries ~55 MB + 874 MB model) — never committed.
# Rebuild: powershell -File Backend/vendor/build_whisper.ps1  (see docs/building.md)
Backend/vendor/whisper/

# OmniSharp-Roslyn sidecar (~46MB) — repoda tutulmaz (video bins deseni).
